# The build context is the repo root, so the images can copy packages/shared
# beside each service. Everything below stays out of every image.

# The archive RPC key lives here and must never reach an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Built on the host for the host. Each image installs its own for Linux.
**/node_modules

.git
.github
app
contracts
# The mainnet record, baked into the api and indexer images for a host with no
# mounts. A fork reads infra/fork-deployment.json, which compose mounts.
!contracts/deployments/4663.json
# The source infra/chain.json is generated from at build time, the same way
# make does it, since the generated file is not committed.
!contracts/script/Addresses.sol
docs
data
# The netting curve export is a published Dune result the api serves at boot, so
# it belongs in the api image rather than in a mount. data/backtest only.
!data/backtest
tools
**/.state
**/.torture
**/*.log
**/test
